<title>HONG KONG: Sino-British Land Comnission to review land sales.</title>
<headline>Sino-British Land Comnission to review land sales.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sino-British Land Commission will hold its 33rd meeting on November 25 to review the 1996/97 land disposal programme and discuss the 1996/97 average cost of land development, the Hong Kong government said on Friday.</p>
<p>British and Chinese negotiators agreed in May to release 153 hectares of land for development in Hong Kong in fiscal 1996/97 (April-March).</p>
<p>This year's allocation is the second highest ever agreed under the Land Disposal Program.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
